      "value": "@{5adf87eeee6da475b8353316|full_name}: While a whitelist would limit creators more it is also more likely to be a better solution that requires less oversight in the long run. (ie someone constantly needing to update the blacklist to keep up with flavor of the month crash particles/prefabs/etc)",
