        "like": 1
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is honestly a horrible implementation and not a very good idea in the first place. \n\nVRC is all about giving you creative freedom, and shaders are one of the only ways to really express that in a big way. \n\nThis implementation would kill that, instantly. \n\nNobody is going to want to go and take their headset off to add a shader to their config whitelist because their friend logged in with a new shader. \n\nAnyone who thinks this would fix anything is ignorant. I'd suggest you study the subject before trying to kill it.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
